The local audit found a concrete correctness bug in the pre-existing harness: item 7 could report PASS without running recovery traffic, and ordinary phase failures could return before `lab.stop`/cleanup evidence. I’m fixing those plus the per-phase sampling/authentication/threshold checks now; these changes remain confined to the M4 harness and fixtures.
apply patch
